 "<div class=\"hearthwrap\"><canvas id=\"hearthCv\" width=\"{0}\" height=\"{1}\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Your Forgelings sitting around a campfire\"></canvas>{2}</div>\n    <p class=\"hmsg\" id=\"hmsg\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">{3}</p>\n    <div class=\"actions hgrid\">\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hAffection\" {4} aria-describedby=\"hmsg\">{5}Sit with<small>Just for company</small></button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hSnack\" {6}>{7}Snack</button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hStory\" {8}>{9}Story</button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hPlay\" {10}>{11}Play{12}</button>\n      {13}\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hForge\">{14}The Forge{15}</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"muted small hvis\">{16}</p>\n    {17}{18}\n    {19}\n    <div class=\"group hcompg\"><button class=\"rowl\" id=\"hComp\"><span class=\"rt\"><b>{20}</b><span class=\"rs\">{21}{22}</span><span class=\"bondbar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"width:{23}%\"></i></span></span><span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span></button></div>{24}\n    <div class=\"chips hmore\">{25}<button class=\"chip\" id=\"hShelf\">Curio shelf</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"hFurn\">By the fire</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"hKeeps\">Keepsakes</button>{26}<button class=\"chip\" id=\"hChange\">Change who is here</button>{27}</div>": "<div class=\"hearthwrap\"><canvas id=\"hearthCv\" width=\"{0}\" height=\"{1}\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"たき火を囲むフォージリングたち\"></canvas>{2}</div>\n    <p class=\"hmsg\" id=\"hmsg\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">{3}</p>\n    <div class=\"actions hgrid\">\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hAffection\" {4} aria-describedby=\"hmsg\">{5}そばに<small>ただ一緒に</small></button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hSnack\" {6}>{7}おやつ</button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hStory\" {8}>{9}お話</button>\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hPlay\" {10}>{11}遊ぶ{12}</button>\n      {13}\n      <button class=\"act\" id=\"hForge\">{14}鍛冶場{15}</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"muted small hvis\">{16}</p>\n    {17}{18}\n    {19}\n    <div class=\"group hcompg\"><button class=\"rowl\" id=\"hComp\"><span class=\"rt\"><b>{20}</b><span class=\"rs\">{21}{22}</span><span class=\"bondbar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"width:{23}%\"></i></span></span><span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span></button></div>{24}\n    <div class=\"chips hmore\">{25}<button class=\"chip\" id=\"hShelf\">珍品の棚</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"hFurn\">炉ばたの品</button><button class=\"chip\" id=\"hKeeps\">宝物</button>{26}<button class=\"chip\" id=\"hChange\">ここにいる子を変える</button>{27}</div>",
